  "constraints": {
    "must": [
      "One accent only: deep petrol teal (light #0E7C7F, dark #2FB0AA). Everything else neutral.",
      "Flat surfaces: hairlines (--border / --border-strong) for definition; shadows only via --shadow-pop on modals and tooltips.",
      "Fira Sans everywhere; times use tabular-nums.",
      "Text contrast >= 4.5:1 for all text tokens on every surface, in both themes.",
      "Radii: 6px controls, 8px inputs/buttons, 12px panels/modals; bubbles 12px with one 4px tail corner.",
      "Icons from lucide-react only (no emoji as UI icons); green reserved for the presence dot."
    ],
    "avoid": [
      "Gradients of any kind (background-image: linear/radial-gradient).",
      "Glassmorphism: backdrop-filter / backdrop-blur.",
      "Glow effects, colourful blur blobs, dot textures.",
      "Neumorphism (inset/raised shadow pairs) and heavy drop shadows.",
      "Pill-shaped buttons or segmented pill controls (tabs are underline-style; theme picker is a checkmark list).",
      "Stacked rounded cards; prefer grouped panels with hairline dividers.",
      "Purple/violet, coral, neon or multi-accent palettes."
    ]
  },
  "decisions": [
    {
      "id": "quiet-ink-redesign",
      "decision": "Replaced the violet/coral neumorphic system with 'Quiet Ink': neutral paper/charcoal surfaces, hairlines instead of shadows, strong type hierarchy, and one petrol-teal accent. The old look read as generic AI-generated design (gradients, glows, glass, blur blobs).",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-17T16:00:00.000Z",
      "source": "src/index.css"
    },
    {
      "id": "single-petrol-accent",
      "decision": "One accent colour only - deep petrol teal (#0E7C7F light / #2FB0AA dark). The coral --accent token was removed and all bg-accent/text-accent usages now use primary. Distinctive without copying WhatsApp green or Telegram blue.",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-17T16:00:00.000Z",
      "source": "src/index.css"
    },
    {
      "id": "flat-surfaces-hairlines",
      "decision": "Controls and panels are flat: solid fills or hairline borders; --shadow-pop is reserved for modals and tooltips. Bubbles are solid teal (outgoing) and white/dark with a hairline (incoming), 12px radius with a 4px tail corner.",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-17T16:00:00.000Z",
      "source": "src/index.css"
    },
    {
      "id": "dense-messaging-lists",
      "decision": "Chat and contact lists use dense 2-line rows with hairline separators, an accent tint for the active chat, tabular timestamps and a CountBadge for unread - reads like a daily messaging product, not marketing UI.",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-17T16:00:00.000Z",
      "source": "src/components/chat/ChatListItem.tsx"
    },
    {
      "id": "profile-grouped-settings",
      "decision": "Profile dropped the gradient hero and 3-up stats row in favour of one grouped settings panel (identity, account, appearance, about, danger). Appearance is a checkmark list, not a segmented pill control.",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-17T16:00:00.000Z",
      "source": "src/pages/app/ProfilePage.tsx"
    },
    {
      "id": "ink-auth-panel",
      "decision": "The auth screen uses a solid ink brand column (--panel) with no gradient or blur, and the auth inputs have no leading icons - restrained and editorial, and the first field keeps autofocus for keyboard users.",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-17T16:00:00.000Z",
      "source": "src/pages/auth/AuthLayout.tsx"
    },
    {
      "id": "programmatic-ui-audit",
      "decision": "UI verification includes a headless-Chrome CDP audit over 14 routes x 2 themes asserting zero gradients/backdrop-filter, no horizontal overflow or offscreen elements, correct accent per theme, and text contrast >= 4.5:1. Used because screenshots cannot be inspected by the agent.",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-17T16:00:00.000Z",
      "source": "docs/DOCUMENTATION.md"
    }
  ],
